been reduced by the lengths of the 2.4053" o.d.
sections which simulate 5" x 6" x 0.375"  plates.
These elements are heavy-duty (120 mph).

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 25 dB,
and SWR over the band < 1.4:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 13.2 dBi.
